  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview&#xA;Execute the function module [RFC_READ_TABLE] by BAPI activity, then search job log ans output the results into worksheet.&#xA;If spool info regarding job log exists, it is also output into worksheet.&#xA;&#xA;- Input/Output&#xA;in_FilePath as file path of Excel file with search criteria&lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_SAPService as SAP session info&lt;IConnectionService&gt;" DisplayName="SRC_JOBLOG_EXPORT_E" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_2">
